abstract: >-
  SageMath and C++ implementations, validation scripts, and exact data for
  completeness numbers of supersingular rank-two Drinfeld-module isogeny
  graphs over finite polynomial rings.
keywords:
  - Drinfeld modules
  - isogeny graphs
  - Brandt matrices
  - finite fields
  - exact computation
